    <div class="pb-8 lg:pb-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="lg:px-4">
            <div class="grid gap-8 content-columns grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="content1 px-4">
                                        <h3><img src="/application/files/4317/4475/0294/drago.jpg" alt="drago.jpg" width="250" height="250" style="float: left; margin-right: 20px">Dragomir Radev</h3>

<p>&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://engineering.yale.edu/news-and-events/news/memoriam-dragomir-radev-professor-computer-science">Yale Engineering: In Memoriam</a><br />
&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://yaleseas.com/remembering-drago/">Memorial website</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="content2 px-4">
                                        <h3><img src="/application/files/3217/7455/4651/mcdermott.jpg" alt="mcdermott.jpg" width="250" height="250" style="float: left; margin-right: 20px;">Drew McDermott</h3>

<p>Drew McDermott, CS Professor Emeritus, was a world-renowned leader in the field of Artificial Intelligence and also served as the Department Chair and Director of Graduate Studies at Yale CS for many years.</p>
                </div>
                                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


    <div class="pb-8 lg:pb-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="lg:px-4">
            <div class="grid gap-8 content-columns grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2">
                <div class="content1 px-4">
                                        <h3><img src="/application/files/7817/4475/1236/eisenstat.jpg" alt="eisenstat.jpg" width="250" height="250" style="float: left; margin-right: 20px;">Stanley Eisenstat</h3>

<p>Stanley Eisenstat, Professor of Computer Science, who taught computer science at Yale for nearly 50 years, passed away on December 17, 2020, at the age of 76, after a brief illness.</p>

<p>&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://ccxxgao.github.io/" target="_blank">Memorial website</a><br />
&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://yaledailynews.com/blog/2020/12/23/the-heartbeat-of-our-department-stanley-eisenstat-professor-of-computer-science-at-yale-for-almost-50-years-dies-at-76/" target="_blank">Yale Daily News article</a><br />
&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://www.yalealumnimagazine.com/articles/5283-a-computer-scientist-loved-for-his-teaching" target="_blank">Yale Alumni article</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="content2 px-4">
                                        <h3><img src="/application/files/6317/4475/1237/hudak.jpg" alt="hudak.jpg" width="250" height="250" style="float: left; margin-right: 20px;">Paul Hudak</h3>

<p>Paul Hudak, Professor of Computer Science for thirty-three years and head of Saybrook College, died on April 29, 2015, after a long battle with leukemia.</p>

<p>&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://news.yale.edu/2015/04/30/memoriam-paul-hudak-computer-scientist-and-saybrook-college-master" target="_blank">Yale News article</a><br />
&bull; <a class="arrow-link" href="https://yaledailynews.com/blog/2015/04/30/hudak-spirited-saybrugian-and-cs-prof-succumbs-to-cancer/" target="_blank">Yale Daily News article</a></p>
                </div>
                                            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>


