<span class="badge badge-secondary">Python</span></div><h5 class="card-title bg-transparent mt-1">FoodPal</h5><div class="card-text bg-transparent secondary-font">Don't know what to make? Foodpal is an easy-to-use recipt suggestion algorithm and generator based on your preferences. It also automatically orders the ingredients for you on DoorDash!</div></div><div class="card-footer py-3"><span class="m-1 mx-2"><a href=https://github.com/jdsuh50/CS411-Team-Project target=_blank><i class="fab fa-github"></i>
</a></span><span class=float-end><a class="btn btn-sm" href=https://github.com/jdsuh50/CS411-Team-Project target=_blank>Github</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=contact class=py-5><div class=container><h3 class=text-center>Get in Touch</h3><div class="px-0 px-md-5 px-lg-5"><div class="row justify-content-center px-md-5"><div class="col-md-8 py-3"><div class=text-center>Don&rsquo;t hesitate to reach out to me if you have any questions or would like to connect. I am always open to new opportunities, meet new people, and learn new knowledge and skills.</div><div class="text-center pt-3"><a href=mailto:albertz@bu.edu target=_blank class=btn>Email Me</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id=contact-form-status></div></section><svg style="display:none"><symbol id="check-circle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M16 8A8 8 0 110 8a8 8 0 0116 0zm-3.97-3.03a.75.75.0 00-1.08.022L7.477 9.417 5.384 7.323a.75.75.0 00-1.06 1.06L6.97 11.03a.75.75.0 001.079-.02l3.992-4.99a.75.75.0 00-.01-1.05z"/></symbol><symbol id="info-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 16A8 8 0 108 0a8 8 0 000 16zm.93-9.412-1 4.705c-.07.34.029.533.304.533.194.0.487-.07.686-.246l-.088.416c-.287.346-.92.598-1.465.598-.703.0-1.002-.422-.808-1.319l.738-3.468c.064-.293.006-.399-.287-.47l-.451-.081.082-.381 2.29-.287zM8 5.5a1 1 0 110-2 1 1 0 010 2z"/></symbol><symbol id="exclamation-triangle-fill" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8.982 1.566a1.13 1.13.0 00-1.96.0L.165 13.233c-.457.778.091 1.767.98 1.767h13.713c.889.0 1.438-.99.98-1.767L8.982 1.566zM8 5c.535.0.954.462.9.995l-.35 3.507a.552.552.0 01-1.1.0L7.1 5.995A.905.905.0 018 5zm.002 6a1 1 0 110 2 1 1 0 010-2z"/></symbol></svg></div><footer><div class="text-center pt-2"><span class=px-1><a href=https://alberttzhao.github.io aria-label=github><svg width="2.7em" height="2.7em" viewBox="0 0 1792 1792"><path id="footer-socialNetworks-github-svg-path" d="M522 1352q-8 9-20-3-13-11-4-19 8-9 20 3 12 11 4 19zm-42-61q9 12 0 19-8 6-17-7t0-18q9-7 17 6